# 8. Calendar

The calendar is one of the primary application surfaces.

Views:

- Day
- Week
- Month
- Staff
- Resources
- Timeline
- Agenda

Features:

- drag-and-drop;
- resize appointment duration;
- filters;
- staff colors/tokens;
- status indicators;
- private appointment masking;
- resource conflict detection;
- working hours;
- breaks;
- holidays;
- blocked time;
- recurring appointments;
- waiting list;
- quick-create;
- mobile agenda view.

Appointment card may display:

```text
10:30
Anna Müller
Haircut
45 min
€55
```

Private appointment for unauthorized staff:

```text
10:30
Busy
60 min
```

No sensitive information should leak through:

- tooltip;
- API response;
- HTML;
- client-side cache;
- search;
- AI context.

