# 23. Unified Inbox

Create a centralized communication inbox.

Initial channels:

- internal website messages;
- booking requests;
- email integration.

Later:

- WhatsApp Business;
- SMS;
- Instagram / Messenger where technically and contractually possible;
- voice assistant.

Inbox features:

- client detection;
- conversation assignment;
- unread state;
- tags;
- priority;
- internal notes;
- AI summary;
- AI reply draft;
- templates;
- conversion to lead / booking / job.

