This is **business finance tracking**, not full accounting software in the first version.

Core features:

- revenue;
- payments;
- invoices;
- unpaid balances;
- refunds;
- discounts;
- payment methods;
- financial buckets;
- staff performance;
- service revenue;
- dashboard summaries.

Views:

```text
Revenue
Invoices
Payments
Outstanding
Financial Buckets
Reports
```

---

# 37. Payments

Payment status:

```text
UNPAID
PARTIALLY_PAID
PAID
REFUNDED
VOID
```

Methods:

- cash;
- bank transfer;
- card;
- online provider;
- custom.

Payment provider integration later / phase-based.

