- permission-safe masking.

### Booking

- public booking page.

### Finance basic

- payment status;
- revenue;
- invoices basic;
- outstanding balances.

### AI

- business assistant;
- schedule lookup;
- client lookup;
- booking creation/movement;
- simple revenue queries;
- action confirmations.

### Dashboard

- Today;
- Needs attention;
- basic revenue;
- appointments;
- requests.

