# 78. Later / Advanced

Possible future additions:

- AI phone receptionist;
- voice commands;
- route optimization for mobile workers;
- WhatsApp automation;
- inventory-lite;
- employee time tracking;
- document generation;
- electronic signatures;
- marketplace integrations;
- API for third-party developers;
- white-label mode.

